  "meta": {
    "name": "lang_guard",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Language guard (073, plan N-angol, jav/lang_guard.py): a ratchet on the number of lines with Hungarian letters per tracked file. A file may not exceed its baseline entry; a file without an entry may not contain any. The baseline only shrinks (lang-guard --update); raising an entry needs lang-guard --accept <path> (document vocabulary, test data). allow: patterns that are never counted (UI translation files).",
